Backport of llvm/llvm-project a558d656 ("[CodeGen] Get rid of incorrect `std`
template specializations", #160804) onto 21.1.8, minus its unit-test hunk.

RDFRegisters.h specialized std::less<RegisterRef> with a data member.  libc++
22 and later static_assert that a std::less specialization used by an
associative container is empty, so llvm:CodeGen does not compile against the
hermetic toolchain's libc++.  Drop this patch with the bump to LLVM 22.

